{"seq":1,"slug":"exchange-mechanics","title":"交易所运行机制与订单类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/market-microstructure/market-structure/exchange-mechanics","wordCount":2740,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"交易所运行机制与订单类型\">交易所运行机制与订单类型</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>交易所是金融市场的核心基础设施，为买卖双方提供标准化的交易撮合服务。从 17 世纪阿姆斯特丹证券交易所的场内喊价，到如今纽约证券交易所（NYSE）每秒处理数百万条消息的电子化系统，交易所的运行机制经历了根本性的变革。理解交易所如何接收、管理和撮合订单，是掌握市场微观结构的第一步。</p>\n<p>现代交易所的核心组件包括：订单管理系统（Order Management System）、撮合引擎（Matching Engine）、市场数据发布系统（Market Data Feed）和风控模块。这些组件协同工作，确保交易过程的公平性、透明性和效率。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>交易所的本质是一个把买卖双方的委托转化为成交的撮合机构，其价值链由订单接入、撮合引擎、行情发布和风控四个环节构成。理解交易所运行机制，需要抓住三组核心范畴：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>撮合机制</strong>：连续竞价（价格-时间优先，即时成交）、集合竞价（集中定价最大化成交量）、做市商制度（报价驱动）以及三者的混合形态；</li>\n<li><strong>订单类型的权衡</strong>：市价订单以执行价格风险换取即时性，限价订单消除价格风险但承担非执行风险与逆向选择风险——这正是 Parlour（1998）框架的核心；</li>\n<li><strong>分配规则</strong>：价格-时间优先按到达顺序排队，Pro-Rata 按数量比例分配，二者对报单行为的激励不同。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心范畴</th>\n<th>关键权衡</th>\n<th>决定的市场属性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>撮合机制</td>\n<td>即时性 vs. 价格发现充分性</td>\n<td>交易连续性与波动特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>订单类型</td>\n<td>执行确定性 vs. 价格风险</td>\n<td>流动性的主动/被动结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配规则</td>\n<td>时间优先 vs. 数量优先</td>\n<td>大单激励与队列排队行为</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"交易所分类与结构\">交易所分类与结构</h2><h3 id=\"按撮合机制分类\">按撮合机制分类</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[交易所撮合机制] --&gt; B[连续竞价&lt;br/&gt;Continuous Auction]&#10;    A --&gt; C[集合竞价&lt;br/&gt;Call Auction]&#10;    A --&gt; D[做市商制度&lt;br/&gt;Dealer Market]&#10;    A --&gt; E[混合制度&lt;br/&gt;Hybrid]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[价格-时间优先&lt;br/&gt;Price-Time Priority]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[按比例分配&lt;br/&gt;Pro-Rata]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[开盘集合竞价]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[收盘集合竞价]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[指定做市商&lt;br/&gt;DMM]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[竞争性做市商]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[NYSE 混合模式]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[上交所 混合模式]\">graph TD\n    A[交易所撮合机制] --&gt; B[连续竞价&lt;br/&gt;Continuous Auction]\n    A --&gt; C[集合竞价&lt;br/&gt;Call Auction]\n    A --&gt; D[做市商制度&lt;br/&gt;Dealer Market]\n    A --&gt; E[混合制度&lt;br/&gt;Hybrid]\n    B --&gt; B1[价格-时间优先&lt;br/&gt;Price-Time Priority]\n    B --&gt; B2[按比例分配&lt;br/&gt;Pro-Rata]\n    C --&gt; C1[开盘集合竞价]\n    C --&gt; C2[收盘集合竞价]\n    D --&gt; D1[指定做市商&lt;br/&gt;DMM]\n    D --&gt; D2[竞争性做市商]\n    E --&gt; E1[NYSE 混合模式]\n    E --&gt; E2[上交所 混合模式]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>撮合机制</th>\n<th>代表交易所</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>连续竞价</td>\n<td>NASDAQ、深交所</td>\n<td>高流动性品种</td>\n<td>即时执行、价格连续</td>\n<td>开盘/收盘价格波动大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>集合竞价</td>\n<td>各交易所开收盘</td>\n<td>低流动性、价格敏感时段</td>\n<td>价格发现充分、减少操纵</td>\n<td>执行延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>做市商制度</td>\n<td>NYSE（DMM）、LSE</td>\n<td>中低流动性品种</td>\n<td>保证流动性供给</td>\n<td>做市商信息优势</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合制度</td>\n<td>NYSE、上交所</td>\n<td>兼顾效率与流动性</td>\n<td>结合两种优势</td>\n<td>规则复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"全球主要交易所技术参数\">全球主要交易所技术参数</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>交易所</th>\n<th>日均交易量（2025）</th>\n<th>撮合延迟</th>\n<th>消息处理能力</th>\n<th>撮合算法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>NYSE</td>\n<td>~20 亿股</td>\n<td>~10μs</td>\n<td>数百万条/秒</td>\n<td>价格-时间 + DMM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>NASDAQ</td>\n<td>~40 亿股</td>\n<td>~15μs</td>\n<td>&gt;100 万条/秒</td>\n<td>价格-时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CME Globex</td>\n<td>~2500 万手合约/日</td>\n<td>~1μs</td>\n<td>&gt;1000 万条/秒</td>\n<td>价格-时间/Pro-Rata</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上交所</td>\n<td>~5000 亿元/日</td>\n<td>~数十μs</td>\n<td>30 万笔/秒（峰值）</td>\n<td>价格-时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>深交所</td>\n<td>~6000 亿元/日</td>\n<td>~数十μs</td>\n<td>30 万笔/秒（峰值）</td>\n<td>价格-时间</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"订单类型体系\">订单类型体系</h2><h3 id=\"基础订单类型\">基础订单类型</h3><p><strong>市价订单（Market Order）</strong> 以当前最优价格立即执行，保证成交但不保证价格。在流动性稀薄时可能产生显著滑点（Slippage）。</p>\n<p><strong>限价订单（Limit Order）</strong> 指定执行价格上限（买入）或下限（卖出）。未立即成交的部分进入订单簿排队。限价订单提供流动性，被称为&quot;被动订单&quot;。</p>\n<p>两者的经济学权衡可以用 Parlour（1998）的框架理解：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>市价订单承担<strong>执行价格风险</strong>（价格不确定性），换取<strong>即时性</strong></li>\n<li>限价订单消除价格风险，但承担<strong>非执行风险</strong>（non-execution risk）和<strong>逆向选择风险</strong>（adverse selection risk）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"高级订单类型\">高级订单类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>订单类型</th>\n<th>英文名称</th>\n<th>功能说明</th>\n<th>典型使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>止损订单</td>\n<td>Stop Order</td>\n<td>价格触及止损价时转为市价单</td>\n<td>风险管理、趋势跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>止损限价</td>\n<td>Stop-Limit</td>\n<td>触发后转为限价单</td>\n<td>精确风控</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>冰山订单</td>\n<td>Iceberg/Reserve</td>\n<td>仅显示部分数量</td>\n<td>大额订单隐藏意图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>即时成交剩余撤销</td>\n<td>IOC (Immediate or Cancel)</td>\n<td>立即成交部分，取消剩余</td>\n<td>算法交易、流动性探测</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全额成交否则撤销</td>\n<td>FOK (Fill or Kill)</td>\n<td>全额成交或全部取消</td>\n<td>大额交易不接受部分成交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>收盘竞价订单</td>\n<td>MOC (Market on Close)</td>\n<td>以收盘价成交</td>\n<td>指数基金再平衡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Peg 订单</td>\n<td>Pegged Order</td>\n<td>锚定 NBBO 自动调整价格</td>\n<td>被动跟随最优报价</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中间价订单</td>\n<td>Midpoint Order</td>\n<td>在买卖中间价成交</td>\n<td>暗池交易、降低冲击</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"有效期指令\">有效期指令</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>GTC</strong>（Good Till Cancelled）：持续有效直到成交或手动取消</li>\n<li><strong>Day</strong>：当日有效，收盘自动取消</li>\n<li><strong>GTD</strong>（Good Till Date）：指定日期前有效</li>\n<li><strong>OPG</strong>（At the Opening）：仅参与开盘集合竞价</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"撮合引擎工作原理\">撮合引擎工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"价格-时间优先算法\">价格-时间优先算法</h3><p>价格-时间优先（Price-Time Priority）是最广泛使用的撮合算法。其核心规则：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>价格优先</strong>：买方出价更高者优先成交；卖方要价更低者优先成交</li>\n<li><strong>时间优先</strong>：同一价格水平上，先到达的订单优先成交</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"class OrderBook:&#10;    def __init__(self):&#10;        self.bids = []  # 买单：按价格降序，同价按时间升序&#10;        self.asks = []  # 卖单：按价格升序，同价按时间升序&#10;&#10;    def match(self, incoming_order):&#10;        trades = []&#10;        if incoming_order.side == &#39;BUY&#39;:&#10;            while (self.asks and incoming_order.remaining &gt; 0&#10;                   and self.asks[0].price &lt;= incoming_order.price):&#10;                best_ask = self.asks[0]&#10;                trade_qty = min(incoming_order.remaining, best_ask.remaining)&#10;                trade_price = best_ask.price&#10;                trades.append(Trade(trade_price, trade_qty))&#10;                incoming_order.remaining -= trade_qty&#10;                best_ask.remaining -= trade_qty&#10;                if best_ask.remaining == 0:&#10;                    self.asks.pop(0)&#10;        return trades\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> OrderBook</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.bids </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 买单：按价格降序，同价按时间升序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.asks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 卖单：按价格升序，同价按时间升序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> match</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, incoming_order):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        trades </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming_order.side </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'BUY'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            while</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.asks </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming_order.remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                   and</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.asks[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> incoming_order.price):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                best_ask </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.asks[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                trade_qty </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> min</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(incoming_order.remaining, best_ask.remaining)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                trade_price </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_ask.price</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                trades.append(Trade(trade_price, trade_qty))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                incoming_order.remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                best_ask.remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trade_qty</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> best_ask.remaining </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">                    self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.asks.pop(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trades</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"pro-rata-分配算法\">Pro-Rata 分配算法</h3><p>Pro-Rata 分配在期货市场（如 CME 的利率期货）中常见。同一价格水平的订单按其数量占该价位总量的比例分配成交量：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>分配量</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>成交总量</mtext><mo>×</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>j</mi></munder><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{分配量}_i = \\text{成交总量} \\times \\frac{Q_i}{\\sum_j Q_j}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">分配量</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">成交总量</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4821em;vertical-align:-1.1218em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4358em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1218em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 个订单的排队数量。这种机制鼓励提交大额限价订单以获得更大的分配比例。</p>\n<h3 id=\"集合竞价撮合\">集合竞价撮合</h3><p>集合竞价在指定时段内收集所有订单，然后确定一个使成交量最大化的单一价格：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>P</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>max</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>P</mi></munder><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≥</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>i</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><munder><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>:</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>≤</mo><mi>P</mi></mrow></munder><msubsup><mi>q</mi><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>k</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P^* = \\arg\\max_P \\min\\left(\\sum_{i: p_i^{bid} \\geq P} q_i^{bid}, \\sum_{j: p_j^{ask} \\leq P} q_j^{ask}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.7774em;vertical-align:-1.7274em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3557em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">max</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7443em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen\"><span class=\"delimsizing mult\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.05em;\"><span style=\"top:-4.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:5.6em;\"></span><span style=\"width:0.875em;height:3.6em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.875em\" height=\"3.6em\" viewBox=